---
title: Introduction
description: What this design system is and how it's put together.
order: 0
---

design-system-ui is a small design system built on top of [shadcn-svelte](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com), documented alongside a live, installable component registry.

Every component, block, and utility in this site is backed by a real file in the `registry/items` folder — the same source used to render its live preview, its Storybook story, and its CLI-installable JSON payload.

## What's here

- **Docs** — installation, styling, and theming guides.
- **Components** — small, composable UI primitives.
- **Blocks** — larger compositions built from components.
- **Utilities** — helpers and hooks shared across the system.
- **Registry** — a flat index of everything above, plus CLI installation via `registry.json`.
- **Search** — press <kbd>⌘K</kbd> (or <kbd>Ctrl K</kbd>) anywhere on the site.
- **`llms.txt`/`.md` twins** — every page has a plain-text or raw-Markdown counterpart for LLM consumption.
- **Accent themes** — light/dark, each with Default, Amber, or Violet accent colors.
